{"id":"n59689-2-11","stage":3,"title":"부리다 · 耍","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59689-2-11-1","ko":"아이가 학교에서 자꾸 말썽을 부려요.","zh":"孩子在学校老是惹麻烦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"학교에서","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교에서","audio":"/audio/9285b891be0b7c5031dc.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"말썽을","meaning":"祸端，是非，麻烦","explanation":"말썽：祸端，是非，麻烦；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말썽","audio":"/audio/4c8359c9702c43015127.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51737","senseId":"1","lemma":"말썽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말썽을","audio":"/audio/f255215b893f591b159a.mp3"}},{"text":"부려요.","meaning":"耍，起，犯，闹","explanation":"부리다：耍，起，犯，闹；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"부리다","audio":"/audio/1ae5473e59c47bdc447f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59689","senseId":"2","lemma":"부리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부려요","audio":"/audio/97b111f3d2df568d3c1f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"4c8359c9702c4301","term":"말썽","zh":"祸端，是非，麻烦","audio":"/audio/4c8359c9702c43015127.mp3","entryId":"51737","definition":"引发问题的言行。","pronunciation":["말ː썽"]},{"id":"1ae5473e59c47bdc","term":"부리다","zh":"耍，起，犯，闹","audio":"/audio/1ae5473e59c47bdc447f.mp3","entryId":"59689","definition":"不断地表现或显示出不正当的行为或脾气。","pronunciation":["부리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/93ca7c80d6b27ac229c3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59689-2-11-2","ko":"죄송합니다, 선생님. 집에서 교육을 잘 시키겠습니다.","zh":"对不起，老师。我们会在家里好好教育他的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송합니다","audio":"/audio/46ce53f2332052b62c9f.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님.","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"교육을","meaning":"教育，培训","explanation":"교육：教育，培训；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55289","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육","origin":"NIKL Korean-